 generation AI — crafted to capture the essence of your photo while elevating it into a cinematic, tactile, and emotionally resonant visual experience:\n\n—\n\nA close-up, first-person perspective shot of a human hand gently cradling a miniature, hyper-realistic gray rubber tire-shaped stress ball — labeled “YOTTTOY” and “50LB” in crisp white sans-serif lettering on its treaded surface. The tire’s textured, hexagonal grip pattern is rendered with photorealistic fidelity, catching soft ambient light that emphasizes its matte silicone finish and slight translucency at the edges. The hand holding it appears relaxed, fingers slightly curled around the ring, skin texture and natural creases visible under warm, diffused daylight. In the softly blurred background, a rustic wooden table holds a woven placemat in pale yellow and cream tones, and partially visible is a ceramic mug with delicate blue floral patterns resting on a round bamboo coaster — suggesting a cozy, domestic setting. The mood is calm, tactile, and subtly nostalgic — like a quiet morning ritual or a moment of mindful decompression. The artistic style blends photorealism with cinematic depth-of-field, using shallow focus to draw attention to the object’s texture and branding while lending warmth and intimacy to the scene. Lighting is natural and directional, casting gentle shadows that enhance dimensionality without harshness. Overall, the composition feels both product-focused and emotionally grounded — inviting the viewer to imagine the softness of the material, the weight of the 50-pound claim, and the quiet satisfaction of holding something designed for relief and play.\n\n—\n\nThis prompt balances specificity with atmospheric storytelling, ensuring the AI understands not just *what* to depict, but *how* to feel and look — maximizing visual impact and emotional resonance."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 144, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"p